        <headline>Gale Warning issued September 24 at 4:13AM AKDT until September 25 at 5:00PM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK</headline>
        <description>Coastal Waters Forecast for the Northern Gulf of Alaska Coast
up to 100 nm out including Kodiak Island and Cook Inlet.

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent an average of the highest
one-third of the combined wind wave and swell height.

.TODAY...SE wind 15 kt. Seas 5 ft.
.TONIGHT...SE wind 25 kt increasing to 35 kt after midnight. Seas
6 ft building to 10 ft after midnight. Rain.
.FRI...SE wind 35 kt. Seas 13 ft. Rain showers.
.FRI NIGHT...S wind 20 kt. Seas 12 ft.
.SAT...S wind 20 kt. Seas 10 ft.
.SUN...SW wind 15 kt. Seas 8 ft.
.MON...NW wind 20 kt. Seas 5 ft.
</description>
